added><lastupdated>2026-10-10</lastupdated><name>Kith</name><summary>Your people — a local-first, p2p address book on Loam</summary><desc>Kith is the contacts app of the Loam ecosystem: a local-first, peer-to-peer address book. A contact can carry a Loam identity, turning it into a grantable principal for other apps (Scala editors, Qaku admins). Books sync across your devices; import/export vCards.</desc><license>Unknown</license><categories>Internet</categories><category>Internet</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/vpavlin/kith</source><tracker></tracker><author>vpavlin</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>6</marketvercode><package><version>0.1.5</version><versioncode>6</versioncode><apkname>kith-0.1.5.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">42c5173f8775664ca745a6fd80d4d45b28f4b995e7d1fcfd114bb6bce8f609ad</hash><size>39323289</size><sdkver>24</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-10</added><sig>4a8a26923dd843178c856a9fde2a827e</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,CAMERA,INTERNET,READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW,USE_BIOMETRIC,USE_FINGERPRINT,VIBRATE,WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,co.logos.delivery.permission.BIND,xyz.vpavlin.kith.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="32" name="android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE"/><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="32" name="android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE"/><nativecode>arm64-v8a</nativecode></package><package><version>0.1.2</version><versioncode>3</versioncode><apkname>kith-0.1.2.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">42ab4ff6c2fd529ee3153a1fee413236de891b73e9ff634afd547641a7e1c065</hash><size>39227214</size><sdkver>24</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-10</added><sig>4a8a26923dd843178c856a9fde2a827e</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,CAMERA,INTERNET,READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,RECORD_AUDIO,SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW,USE_BIOMETRIC,USE_FINGERPRINT,VIBRATE,WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,co.logos.delivery.permission.BIND,xyz.vpavlin.kith.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="32" name="android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE"/><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="32" name="android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE"/><nativecode>arm64-v8a</nativecode></package></application><application id="xyz.vpavlin.loam"><id>xyz.vpavlin.loam</id><added>2026-10-10</added><lastupdated>2026-10-10</lastupdated><name>Loam</name><summary>The shared node your local-first apps grow in — one Logos Delivery node per phone</summary><desc>Loam is the soil your Logos apps grow in: one shared Logos Delivery node per phone, used by every app over IPC, so ten apps don't each run their own node. Per-app consent, end-to-end encrypted (Loam only ever moves sealed bytes), and an opt-in offline cache that holds a closed app's messages so it reopens without re-syncing. It also runs a Bluetooth LE mesh, so nearby phones sync with no internet at all.</desc><license>Unknown</license><categories>System</categories><category>System</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/vpavlin/loam</source><tracker></tracker><author>vpavlin</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>55</marketvercode><package><version>0.0.55</version><versioncode>55</versioncode><apkname>loam-0.0.55.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">ea7c8552af92d907f1fc8777d9d50297783892c79ecb536ea3c4229e765c1036</hash><size>51456767</size><sdkver>23</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>34</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-10</added><sig>b004a2470b0626b25683441508275712</sig><permissions>ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION,ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,BLUETOOTH,BLUETOOTH_ADMIN,BLUETOOTH_ADVERTISE,BLUETOOTH_CONNECT,BLUETOOTH_SCAN,CAMERA,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,READ_APP_BADGE,READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,RECORD_AUDIO,SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW,USE_BIOMETRIC,USE_FINGERPRINT,VIBRATE,WAKE_LOCK,WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE,com.anddoes.launcher.permission.UPDATE_COUNT,com.google.android.c2dm.permissi